+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only */
+/* Included by npu_kite_datapath.c: all mutable state belongs to hart4.
+ * Bind initializes while workers are parked. The ARM only reads snapshots.
+ * Profiling never changes admission, tokens, ring budgets or completion. */
